{"title": "War Paint (Condition)", "pageid": 53000, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/War_Paint_(Condition)", "categories": ["Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/War_Paint_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-War_Paint_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/War_Paint_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-War_Paint_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/War_Paint_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-War_Paint_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"War Paint Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/War_Paint_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-War_Paint_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/War_Paint_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>War Paint</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Decorated with worg dung. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">GOB_WARPAINT</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:GOB_WARPAINT+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:GOB_WARPAINT+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Removed by obtaining the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wet_(Condition)\" title=\"Wet (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wet\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wet_(Condition)\" title=\"Wet (Condition)\">Wet</a> condition.</li>\n<li>Obtained by talking to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Olak\" title=\"Olak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_Olak.png/25px-Portrait_Olak.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_Olak.png/38px-Portrait_Olak.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_Olak.png/50px-Portrait_Olak.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sentinel Olak\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_Olak.png/25px-Portrait_Olak.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d9/Portrait_Olak.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Olak\" title=\"Olak\">Sentinel Olak</a> and smearing worg dung on the interacting party member's face during the conversation.</li>\n<li>Talking to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Klaw\" title=\"Klaw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Portrait_Klaw.png/25px-Portrait_Klaw.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Portrait_Klaw.png/38px-Portrait_Klaw.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Portrait_Klaw.png/50px-Portrait_Klaw.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Klaw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Portrait_Klaw.png/25px-Portrait_Klaw.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Portrait_Klaw.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Klaw\" title=\"Klaw\">Klaw</a> with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Animals\" title=\"Speak with Animals\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/25px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/38px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/50px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Speak with Animals\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/25px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Animals\" title=\"Speak with Animals\">Speak with Animals</a> reveals the worg dung was produced by her.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203052